  "description": "MIGZAG crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 F36 N8 O20 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.838-3.945 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.86-110.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Tb4.",
